# FORMAT-03 ThumbHash golden manifest.
#
# Each line selects one vendored cooked ThumbHash fixture: the 3-byte magic
# "\xC3\xBE\xFE" (the 'þ' THORN identifier mandated by Wuffs'
# decode_thumbhash.wuffs; QUIRK_JUST_RAW_THUMBHASH is disabled in the guest,
# so the magic is required) followed by the raw thumbhash payload. The
# canonical decode evidence was produced by the upstream Wuffs decoder
# (wuffs-mirror-release-c/release/c/wuffs-v0.4.c, the exact decoder embedded
# in the wasm guest) using the guest's decode parameters from wasm/shim.c:
# pixel format BGRA_PREMUL, blend SRC, workbuf = workbuf_len().max_incl. The
# CRC-32 (IEEE) is over the width*height*4 straight (non-premultiplied) RGBA
# bytes the Go host writes into the caller's image.RGBA Pix, i.e. the raw
# guest bytes with B and R swapped and each channel unpremultiplied via
# (c*255)/a, matching convertBGRAToStraight. Values were computed by an
# independent C oracle program against the upstream decoder; none were taken
# from this package's own decoder. The oracle was validated against the
# canonical upstream thumbhash C test's final-pixel value 0xFF56632E for
# 3OcRJYB4d3h_iIeHeEh3eIhw-j3A.th.
#
# The has_alpha, l_count, and is_landscape columns are the variant properties
# decoded from the payload header per decode_thumbhash.wuffs: has_alpha
# selects 0 or 14 A AC coefficients, l_count selects the number of L AC
# coefficients (3..=7), and is_landscape swaps the width and height codes.
# Together they span the upstream fixtures' alpha presence (0 and 1),
# orientation (portrait, landscape, square), aspect ratio (18/32, 23/32,
# 32/23, 32/32), and encoded coefficient-count (4 and 5) variants.
#
# Fixtures come from ../wuffs/test/data/artificial-thumbhash (evanw/thumbhash
# reference examples, cooked with the 3-byte Wuffs magic by the upstream
# make.go) and ../wuffs/test/data/mona-lisa.21x32.th. The mona-lisa fixture
# named "21x32" after its source PNG decodes to 23x32: thumbhash dimension
# codes only offer 14/18/19/23/26/27/32, and 23 is the closest code above 21.
#
# Columns: file width height straight_rgba_crc32 has_alpha l_count is_landscape
mona-lisa.21x32.th 23 32 728019323 0 5 0
